'''Suus''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Dragontail}}.

== Quest ==
If the player is a member of the Barbarian [[Faction]], '''Suus''' asks the player to find [[Turd]]'s [[Toy]] by killing [[Magma Cube Rider]]s. If the player contacts via [[Abiphones|Abiphone]] call, Suus will give a different mob. 

The Toy has a {{Green|10%}} chance to drop. Returning the Toy will reward the player with {{Reputation|barbarian|+40}}. This can be done once every 2 days.

