== Trivia ==
*'''Suus'''<nowiki/>'s name could be a reference to the term "sus," short for "suspicious," popularized by the video game [[w:Among Us|Among Us]].
** The name could also be a reference to the scientific name of a pig, ''Sus scrofa domesticus'', since the [[Barbarian Faction]] used to be pigs.

